    <string name="account_faq1_q">How do I get my ticket?</string>
    <string name="account_faq1_a">After payment the e-ticket appears in My Trips and is sent by SMS and email. It opens without internet too.</string>
    <string name="account_faq2_q">How do refunds work?</string>
    <string name="account_faq2_a">Before you cancel we show the exact refund amount from the fare rules. Money goes back to the same payment method.</string>
    <string name="account_faq3_q">Why is NID needed for train tickets?</string>
    <string name="account_faq3_a">Bangladesh Railway issues tickets against a registered NID, so each adult passenger must give one.</string>
